--- !u!114 &8347391788655017296
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 5707168636829182032}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 12f5a30821a95064a903a7b6c847004c, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: '::'
  audioFollowTarget: {fileID: 763583609}
  volume: 1.5
  lines:
  - id: A
    dialogueEvent:
      Guid:
        Data1: -1671348161
        Data2: 1289002779
        Data3: -758632269
        Data4: -771272510
      Path: event:/Dialogue/Nivel 1/Dicks/Dick1
    subtitle: "Oh. You're awake. Excellent. You are officially my cognitive experiment
      number\u2026 Well, I lost count after the guy who acted like a horse."
  - id: B
    dialogueEvent:
      Guid:
        Data1: 1599547165
        Data2: 1282655608
        Data3: 1691149457
        Data4: -312222029
      Path: event:/Dialogue/Nivel 1/Dicks/Dick1_2
    subtitle: I am a superior intelligence based on the mind of Elon Dicks, but enhanced.
      Without unnecessary empathy.
  - id: C
    dialogueEvent:
      Guid:
        Data1: -1574816717
        Data2: 1081995017
        Data3: 2146296728
        Data4: 1727518300
      Path: event:/Dialogue/Nivel 1/Dicks/Dick3_1
    subtitle: "Your only objective is to tell me where you are. If you guess correctly\u2026
      well\u2026 my life is connected to the door. But don't worry. A little kid
      could never figure it out. "
  - id: Clue1
    dialogueEvent:
      Guid:
        Data1: -1720708502
        Data2: 1188449916
        Data3: -1904022083
        Data4: 2044853309
      Path: event:/Dialogue/Nivel 1/Dicks/Dicks4_HC
    subtitle: This place saw worse decisions than the launch of Mortal Kombat without
      the blood code.
  - id: Clue2
    dialogueEvent:
      Guid:
        Data1: -1829960563
        Data2: 1185818513
        Data3: 632405380
